  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Estimates of the total number of people per grid cell for Russian Federation for each year from 2015 to 2030, R2025A version v1. The files are Geotiffs at 100m and 1km resolution, in the WGS84 Geographic Coordinate System. The units are number of people per pixel. More information can be found in the [Release Statement](https://data.worldpop.org/repo/prj/Global_2015_2030/R2025A/doc/Global2_Release_Statement_R2025A_v1.pdf) **File Descriptions** Each resource is a Geotiff for one year and resolution, named: *iso*\\_*pop*\\_*year*\\_*type*\\_*resolution*.tif *iso* Three-letter country code *year* Year that the population represents *type* CN = [Constrained](https://www.worldpop.org/methods/top_down_constrained_vs_unconstrained/) *resolution* Resolution of the data: 100m is 3 arc, approximately 100m at the equator; 1km is 30 arc, approximately 1km at the equator"
  ],
